<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/"><span></span>StockTap</a><nav><a href="/problems/">Problems we fix</a><a href="/videos/">Videos</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/auth">Sign in</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Deliveries take ages to check</span>
        <h1>Paste the delivery in. Don&#x27;t type it.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Fifty lines on a delivery email, and every one has to go into stock by hand. StockTap reads the email for you.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-checking-deliveries-top">Start free</a><a class="btn2" href="/#tour">Watch the tour</a>
        <p class="note">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="phone"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/poster-paste-delivery.jpg" src="/media/stocktap-paste-delivery.mp4" aria-label="Paste a delivery email"></video></div>
    </div>
    <h2>How StockTap sorts it</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><b>Copy the whole email, paste it in</b><p>Select all, copy, paste. StockTap picks out the supplier, date, order numbers and every line.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Lines matched to your products</b><p>Different names on the delivery? StockTap matches them, remembers the supplier code, and asks you only about the ones it isn&#x27;t sure of.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>New lines added in one tap</b><p>Something not in your library yet? Add it from the delivery with its size and pack already filled in.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>The right units</b><p>Kegs, casks, cases of 24, boxes of postmix, each counted the way it&#x27;s delivered.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Never added twice</b><p>Paste the same email again and StockTap shows which lines are already in.</p></div>
    </div>
    <h2>What you need</h2>
    <div class="need">The delivery email from your supplier. On Premium you can also photograph a paper delivery note.</div>
    <div class="cta">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Try it on your own bar</h2>
      <p style="color:#8A9099">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time. Your phone is all you need to start.</p>
      <a class="btn" style="margin-top:14px" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-checking-deliveries-bottom">Start free</a>
    </div>
    <h2>Other things StockTap sorts</h2>
    <div class="more">
      <a href="/problems/what-to-order">I never know what to order →</a>
      <a href="/problems/stocktake-down">My stocktake says I&#x27;m down →</a>
      <a href="/problems/busy-weekends">Busy weekends catch me short →</a>
      <a href="/problems/postmix">Postmix never adds up →</a>
      <a href="/problems/venners-audit">Got a Venners audit? →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="author">Written by Shaun McManus, licensee in Washington, Tyne &amp; Wear, who built StockTap to run behind his own bar.</p>
  </main>
  <footer><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/problems/">Problems we fix</a><a href="/videos/">How-to videos</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/tools/">Free tools</a><a href="mailto:hello@stocktap.net">hello@stocktap.net</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
